The primary one, of course,
is business continuity

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.170
for these mission-critical
environments.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:55.503
They got to stay up and running.

00:00:55.503 --> 00:00:58.380
They got to stay up and running
to support the business.

