essentially, it

00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:25.780
provides a way to
extract the API layer

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:27.400
so that you're protected.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:30.790
Your downstream
applications are protected

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:34.910
from this kind of testing.

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:37.480
So infrastructure as a
