00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:21.460
and leverage our
integration that we have,

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:27.550
SAP and HANA and Google
Cloud, BigQuery integration,

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:30.430
and really maximize the
decision-making power

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:36.370
that you can pull out of this
set of combined data sources.

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:40.960
Then there's also amazing
power with machine-learning

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:46.400
capabilities, and so many really
exciting use cases in the SAP

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:47.650
