00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:50.110
Like automating business
processes, so many

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:53.200
to automate there, use cases
around better understanding

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:56.290
your customer, sales,
and marketing use cases,

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:59.650
