chain automation as well.

00:16:59.650 --> 00:17:01.930
And Google Cloud
offers the ability

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:06.940
to combine our very powerful
AI-ML toolset, along with also

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:09.609
