for very powerful insights.

00:17:29.227 --> 00:17:31.310
There's one example I want
to share with you here,

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:35.170
which is a customer
we have, AES,

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:37.330
who is a energy
company, actually.

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:40.180
And their use case for
Google Cloud machine learning

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:43.210
