so specifically using

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:52.270
AutoML for predicting
cracks in windmill turbines.

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:55.420
The way it works is they've got
a set of drones that fly around

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:58.960
these windmill turbines all
day long during daylight hours

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:01.600
