in the thousands back.

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:08.620
And those photographs,
if they had

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:11.107
to be analyzed by
hand or by humans,

00:18:11.107 --> 00:18:13.690
it would take forever, right,
to be looking, studying them all

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:17.873
and looking for inconsistencies
or cracks or issues.

00:18:17.873 --> 00:18:19.540
But what they've done
instead is they've

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:24.490
leveraged Google Cloud's AutoML
Vision capability, trained

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:29.980
a model to very highly
accurately detect cracks

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:32.770
and issues with the turbines.

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:36.880
And they've saved
the 57,000 hours

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:40.440
of manual time, $10
million in cost savings

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:44.790
by automating this capability
with Google Cloud's

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:47.010
